module

import PrimeCert

/-! # Benchmark workload for the eager-reduction comparison

Certifies the 1178-digit Proth prime `3 * 2 ^ 3912 + 1`, the largest certificate in the test
suite, so that a per-run difference between the two arms has room to register. Driven by the
`eager-ab` workflow, which times this file against a tree with the eager-reduction wrappers
removed.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

set_option maxRecDepth 2048 in
set_option exponentiation.threshold 3912 in
example : Nat.Prime (3 * 2 ^ 3912 + 1) := prime_cert%
  [small {3},
   pock3 (, 11, 0, 2 ^ 3912 * 3)]
